    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Items</head>
                <p xml:id="del-2025-07-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#Eva" modified="2025-07-01T00:37:07.78+09:00" resp-del="#Eva" src-id="KR2e0003-de-1da56f09">kann es nie genug haben. und nicht genug haben kann</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#Eva" modified="2025-07-01T00:37:34.199+09:00" resp-del="#Eva" src-id="KR2e0003-de-1da56f09">nicht erschöpfen die Erde unter dem Himmel, solange nicht alle Erde unter dem Himmel erschöpft ist</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#Eva" modified="2025-07-01T00:40:41.899+09:00" resp-del="#Eva" src-id="KR2e0003-de-1da56f09">macht sich der König inmitten des Meers/ im Meer zum Diener</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#Eva" modified="2025-07-01T00:41:09.09+09:00" resp-del="#Eva" src-id="KR2e0003-de-1da56f09">Qin's Wille ist nicht satt, macht es sich die Könige im Meer zum Diener</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#Eva" modified="2025-07-01T00:42:50.924+09:00" resp-del="#Eva" src-id="KR2e0003-de-1da56f09">ist der Wille von Qin nicht satt.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#Eva" modified="2025-07-01T00:43:25.843+09:00" resp-del="#Eva" src-id="KR2e0003-de-1da56f09">ist das Verlangen von Qin nicht gesättigt.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#Eva" modified="2025-07-01T00:43:26.168+09:00" resp-del="#Eva" src-id="KR2e0003-de-1da56f09">ist das Verlangen von Qin nicht gesättigt.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#Eva" modified="2025-07-01T00:44:30.769+09:00" resp-del="#Eva" src-id="KR2e0003-de-1da56f09">Nun hat Qin den König von Han bereits gefangen genommen</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#Eva" modified="2025-07-01T00:44:50.735+09:00" resp-del="#Eva" src-id="KR2e0003-de-1da56f09">Nun hat das Reich Qin den König von Han bereits gefangen genommen</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#Eva" modified="2025-07-01T00:45:34.356+09:00" resp-del="#Eva" src-id="KR2e0003-de-1da56f09">vollkommen eingenommen sein Land/Territorium</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#Eva" modified="2025-07-01T00:45:49.82+09:00" resp-del="#Eva" src-id="KR2e0003-de-1da56f09">darüber hinaus mobilisiert es Truppen im Süden um Chu zu bekämpfen.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#Eva" modified="2025-07-01T00:45:58.136+09:00" resp-del="#Eva" src-id="KR2e0003-de-1da56f09">im Norden nähert [es] sich an Zhao an.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#Eva" modified="2025-07-01T00:47:14.145+09:00" resp-del="#Eva" src-id="KR2e0003-de-1da56f09">und es sich die Könige inmitten des Meers zum Diener gemacht hat</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0003_tls_476-5a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#Eva" modified="2025-07-01T00:47:23.925+09:00" resp-del="#Eva" src-id="KR2e0003-de-1da56f09">und es sich die Könige im ganzen Reich zum Diener gemacht hat</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0001_tls_006-18a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T02:21:54.999+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2e0001-en-a0c7c527">Zǐ Mù looked somber,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0001_tls_006-18a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T02:21:54.999+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2e0001-en-a0c7c527">and said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0001_tls_006-18a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T02:21:54.999+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2e0001-en-a0c7c527">"What do you think of trying to summon him?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0001_tls_006-18a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T02:21:54.999+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2e0001-en-a0c7c527">If we summon him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0001_tls_006-18a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T02:21:54.999+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2e0001-en-a0c7c527">will he come?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0001_tls_006-18a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T02:21:54.999+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2e0001-en-a0c7c527">He replied:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0001_tls_006-19a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T03:09:38.744+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2e0001-en-a0c7c527"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0001_tls_006-19a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T03:09:38.744+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2e0001-en-a0c7c527">6.5 Wǔ Jǔ Discusses the Beauty of the Terrace and the Peril of Chǔ</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0001_tls_006-20a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T03:09:38.744+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2e0001-en-a0c7c527"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0001_tls_006-20a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T03:09:38.744+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2e0001-en-a0c7c527">King Líng built the Terrace of Zhānghuá.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0001_tls_006-20a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T03:09:38.744+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2e0001-en-a0c7c527">He ascended it with Wǔ Jǔ,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2e0001_tls_006-20a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T03:09:38.744+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR2e0001-en-a0c7c527">and said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_011-21a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T04:28:07.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR3c0005-en-3adf336a">"It is not something I can control."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_011-22a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T04:28:07.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR3c0005-en-3adf336a"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_011-22a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T04:28:07.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR3c0005-en-3adf336a">Now, a ruler of a state</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_011-22a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T04:28:07.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR3c0005-en-3adf336a">even if it has vast territory and a large population,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_011-22a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T04:28:07.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR3c0005-en-3adf336a">if the ruler is obstructed and blinded,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_011-22a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T04:28:07.582+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR3c0005-en-3adf336a">and the ministers monopolize power,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_011-26a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T05:57:50.531+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR3c0005-en-3adf336a"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_011-26a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T05:57:50.531+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR3c0005-en-3adf336a">Now, if one follows in the footsteps of Qí and Jìn,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_011-26a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T05:57:50.531+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR3c0005-en-3adf336a">and desires the state to be secure and to exist,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_011-26a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T05:57:50.531+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR3c0005-en-3adf336a">it is impossible.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_011-27a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T05:57:50.531+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR3c0005-en-3adf336a"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_011-27a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T05:57:50.531+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR3c0005-en-3adf336a">In general, the difficulty in implementing laws and methods lies in this.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_011-31a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T05:58:19.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR3c0005-en-3adf336a">and even more, they cannot use bending the law as a means of governing.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_011-31a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T05:58:19.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR3c0005-en-3adf336a">Thus, the cultivated and wise will not serve the attendants,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_011-31a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T05:58:19.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR3c0005-en-3adf336a">and will not listen to requests and solicitations.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_011-32a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T05:58:19.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR3c0005-en-3adf336a"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_011-32a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T05:58:19.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR3c0005-en-3adf336a">The attendants of the ruler</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3c0005_tls_011-32a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T05:58:19.692+09:00" resp-del="#gemini-2.0-flash" src-id="KR3c0005-en-3adf336a">do not act like Bó Yí (伯夷).</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
